Description: 'SAS' and 'R' are different in many ways. To ease the
    transition, there are some convenience functions aimed at replicating
    'SAS' analyses in a way that is slightly idiomatic to 'R' and 'SAS'
    users. The emphasis is on ease of use, compatibility, and
    discoverability.
